│ 30, "title": "Stroke with transfusions changing to hydroxyurea (SWiTCH)", "abstract": "Stroke is a devastating       │
│ complication of sickle cell anemia (SCA) with high recurrence if untreated. Chronic transfusions reduce recurrent    │
