│ registered at ClinicalTrials.gov NCT00122980.ashpublications.org"}, {"study_index": 31, "title": "Lactate            │
│ dehydrogenase as a biomarker of hemolysis‐associated nitric oxide resistance, priapism, leg ulceration, pulmonary    │
│ hypertension, and death in patients with sickle cell disease", "abstract": "Pulmonary hypertension is prevalent in   │
│ adult patients with sickle cell disease and is strongly associated with early mortality and markers of hemolysis, in │
